subckt dut (VDD VSS VG)
model DIODE diode is=1e-14 n=1
D1 (net2 net0) DIODE
Ii (VSS net3) isource dc=1m
M1 (net1 VG net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net2 net1 VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RD1 (VDD net1) resistor r=525
RD2 (net0 VSS) resistor r=250
RF (net3 net0) resistor r=500
